  "title": "Building a fast cross-platform image renderer",
  "summary": "Photoroom initially developed as an iPhone app, utilizing Apple's Core Image framework for efficient image processing, leading to rapid development by a small team; however, when expanding to Android, they found existing options lacking and created their own solution, PhotoGraph, inspired by Core Image, focusing on flexibility, performance, and portability across platforms.",
